{
 "suite": "web-subset-v2",
 "note": "HUP-S5.3: ten multi-step tasks over local fixture sites, served from 127.0.0.1 by the test (pages below, matched by path; query strings are read by the pages' own scripts). Each task is a goal, the values it asks to enter, and an end-state check on the page. A run succeeds when the picker says done and the page meets the check at that moment. Not the WebVoyager benchmark: a small, harder-than-v1 floor with distractors, hidden panels, a cookie banner and multi-field forms.",
 "tasks": [
